 "description": "Elevate your spaces with our sleek, minimalist Under Cabinet Light, featuring 54 bright LEDs that emit a comfortable 2700K ~ 6000K light. This energy-efficient, motion-sensor light automatically turns on and off, detecting movement up to 5 meters away and lasting up to 25 days on a single charge. The built-in magnetic base and included nano glue tape allow for easy, non-destructive installation on any metal or surface. It's perfect for kitchens, bedrooms, closets, and more. Enjoy the convenience of USB rechargeability and a lightweight, shatterproof design.",
 "domainId": 2,
