  "pickAndPackFee": 229
 },
 "features": [
  "2700K ~ 6000K Brightness: JEKEMORYE under cupboard kitchen lights has 86 LEDs per Light, 6000K strong cool white Illumination, it will create a brighter lighting environment. With high brightness and anti-glare design, soft light will be no harmless to human eyes, perfect for brightening up your kitchen, bedroom, closet, cabinet, workshop, garage, stairwell, hallway, storage room and more",
  "How long does the battery last? - The light has a built-in 1100mAh rechargeable battery that the actual battery life will depend on how often the motion sensor is triggered. In areas with frequent movement, the battery may need charging more often than the maximum 25 days",
  "What if the battery dies completely? - Based on our fans says, these lights generally hold their charge well, though some users have experienced shorter battery life with certain units. If the battery dies completely, simply recharge it using the included USB-C cable. The light has built-in battery protection features, so a completely dead battery won't damage the unit",
  "Provide an Solution for Sensor Insensitivity on the Market: Under cabinet kitchen lights has a built-in motion sensor. In induction mode, the cabinet light with 120\u00b0 Lighting Angle will automatically detect the movement of the human body in the range of 3-5m, Any minor movement will immediately turn on the light. Conversely, it will turn off automatically when no movement is detected in 25 sec",
  "2 Working Modes: First one, Night detection mode: it will turn on only when movement is detected in a dark environment, Second one, Always on mode. 2 working modes of the motion sensor lights indoor meets all your different needs and ensures an extra long life for your strip lights"
 ],
